start.question:
This image is the side camera at the start of a robot episode, before the robot has moved anything. The robot's task is to stack plates of the same colour: pink on pink, white on white (green plates are distractors). Look only at plates lying on the black tablecloth in front of the robot; ignore plates at the back edge of the table, on or beside the whiteboard or the shelf, plates holding a cup, and cups.
For pink and for white, answer:
- two_or_more_apart: at least two plates of that colour that are not all in one stack yet, so the robot still has to stack them;
- already_stacked: all plates of that colour already lie on each other in one stack (two stacked plates look like one plate with a thicker, doubled rim);
- one_or_none: at most one plate of that colour;
- unclear: the image does not show it.
